From cdd9614e3f56eceb9ea31563de201ddfb1996f64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "nipuna.dulara" <pererannd.21@uom.lk>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 09:03:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] nr: Add NrEnergyHelper so setting up the energy framework
 is one call

Without this, a scenario has to create the gNB/UE energy models by
hand, attach a listener to each PHY, and connect everything to an
energy source itself. NrEnergyHelper does all of that in one call:
InstallGnb/InstallUe take the device containers and the energy sources
and wire up the rest. Also add cttc-nr-energy-example, which shows the
whole flow end to end and prints the energy each device used.
---
